# Testing Rules

- Framework: xUnit + NSubstitute (or Moq if already in project).
- Arrange–Act–Assert clearly separated.
- Name tests: `Method_Scenario_Expected`.
- Cover success + at least one failure path for handlers/services.
- Do not hit real network/DB in unit tests.
- Prefer testing behavior via public API of the unit under test.
- After adding tests: `dotnet test` must pass.
